  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the cozy warmth and rustic charm of the great outdoors with this beautiful hunting-themed bedding. Featuring a realistic illustration of a loving deer couple in a quiet forest clearing, this custom quilt brings a touch of wildlife serenity and sentimental connection right into your home. Beautifully designed for couples and outdoor enthusiasts, it serves as a wonderful custom keepsake or a thoughtful gift for birthdays, anniversaries, holidays, and special family milestones.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> This personalizable quilt supports custom text input, allowing you to add names, special dates, or meaningful sayings to make it uniquely yours.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted from a comfortable blend of 70% cotton and 30% polyester with a high-quality silk floss filling for lightweight, breathable, and year-round warmth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfectly suited for indoor and outdoor activities, making it excellent as a bed quilt, cozy sofa throw, picnic mat, or camping blanket.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Complete Bedding Set:</strong> Designed as a cohesive set that includes one custom quilt with the option to include two matching pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Simple and convenient to maintain; machine wash separately in cold water and air dry or tumble dry without heat for a quick, fluffy finish.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Floss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Animal Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Deer Couple Hunting</td>\n</tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Wildlife, Hunting</td>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Deer Couple-05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
